/shows/d9aff882-db24-4ec7-bf21-e03b8d29659f.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk45/shows/6d22dccf-ebe8-4723-b310-04c87d79170e.jpg","likes":36,"dislikes":1,"views":4238,"release_date":"989539200000","length":6490,"description":"Is becoming a woman analogous, in some deep psychological way, to becoming a werewolf? Ginger is 16, edgy, tough, and, with her younger sister, into staging and photographing scenes of death. They've made a pact about dying together. In early October, on the night she has her first period, which is also the night of a full moon, a werewolf bites Ginger. Within a few days, some serious changes happen to her body and her temperament. Her sister Brigitte, 15, tries to find a cure with the help of Sam, a local doper. As Brigitte races against the clock, Halloween and another full moon approach, Ginger gets scarier, and it isn't just local dogs that begin to die.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.8}],"value":6.8,"age":"R"},"episode_id":5520,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}